                <pb facs="0739" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg677"/>

                <p rendition="#center">(Sent from Camargo on the 27th of April, 1878.)</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">To the Minister of War:</p>
                <p>As stated by Cuellar, the enlisted men from the other side crossed to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed>SERVANDO CANALES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
